    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.stratiotai.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.stratiotai.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_stratiotai">
        <head>ΣΤΡΑΤΙΩΤΑΙ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-1">
          <head>Ι.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-1-l1">Ὁρῶν τι βούλευσαι κατὰ σαυτὸν γενόμενος·</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-1-l2">τὸ συμφέρον γὰρ οὐχ ὁρᾶται τῷ βοᾶν,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-1-l3">ἐν τῷ πρὸς αὑτὸν δ᾽ ἀναλογισμῷ φαίνεται.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Orion Gnomol. I 17: ἐκ τῶν Στρατιωτῶν Μενάνδρου.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Primo versu Schneidewinus ὁρμῶν. Non credo corruptum esse ὁρῶν, <quote>dispiciens, consultans.</quote> Substantivo ὅρασις similiter usus est Menander Disexapat. p. 105. Idem Epicl. p. 118 ὅρα σὺ καὶ φρόντιζε. Cfr Thucyd. VI 4.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2-l1">Latet omne crimen dum fit, sed quantum siet</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2-l2">scelus, peracto scelere demum intellegas.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2_2">
          <head>ΙΙ.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2_2-l1">Οὐδεὶς ξύνοιδεν ἐξαμαρτάνων πόσον</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-stratiotai-2_2-l2">ἁμαρτάνει τὸ μέγεθος, ὕστερον δ᾽ ὁρᾷ.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Servavit Stobaeus Flor. IV 7 cum lemmate τοῦ αὐτοῦ Στρατιώταις. Cfr Schneidewinum ad Orionis l. l.</note>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
